## Summary
Genova's Mayor Bucci expresses frustration over port area conflicts and denies allegations that Morandi bridge funds were used for a favor to Spinelli, calling it a falsehood.

## Key Points
- Mayor Bucci frustrated with constant conflicts in Genova's port areas
- Denies Morandi bridge funds were used as a favor to Spinelli
- Claims the funds are unrelated to the alleged favor


